C</given-names></name><name><surname>Baragi</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Lesch</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Roark</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Datta</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Guzman</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Han</surname><given-names>H-K</given-names></name><name><surname>Dyer</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Discovery and characterization of a novel inhibitor of matrix metalloprotease-13 that reduces cartilage damage <italic>in vivo </italic>without joint fibroplasia side effects</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2007</year><volume>282</volume><fpage>27781</fpage><lpage>27791</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17623656</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.M703286200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Forman</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The peroxisome proliferator-activated receptors: ligands and activators</article-title><source>Ann N Y Acad Sci</source><year>1996</year><volume>804</volume><fpage>266</fpage><lpage>275</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8993549</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1749-6632.1996.tb18621.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mangelsdorf</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The RXR heterodimers and orphan receptors</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>1995</year><volume>83</volume><f